[Quotes]
;Gill winquotes
victory1 = "Immortality is not a gift. It is a responsibility."
victory2 = "It is natural for you to desire that which you can never have or achieve!"
victory3 = "Two centuries... A mere blink upon the face of eternity..."
victory4 = "You will have to exceed your limitations if you wish to survive."
victory5 = "Ignorant of your own incompetence... What a fool."
victory6 = "With your ignorance, you only see destruction. It is in fact, a prelude to rebirth!"
victory7 = "If you trained harder, maybe you wouldn't fall so quickly. Pathetic!"
victory8 = "You call yourself well-trained? Obviously humans follow the wrong leaders... anyone but me!"
victory9 = "So weak! Are you trying to dull my fighting senses?!"
victory10 = "Look into my eyes! I'll carve the mark of defeat on your brow."
victory11 = "You did well, for one of the sheep. Challenge me again when you learn from your mistakes."
victory12 = "The stage has been set. Do not interfere with my grand performance!"
victory13 = "Are you paralyzed yet? You're way below my expectations, but that's nothing new."
victory14 = "I admire your courage, but you'd be a fool to stand against me again."
victory15 = "A super being's influences is the key to his powers."
victory16 = "My methods may seem harsh in contrast to my true intentions."
victory17 = "Rest for now, then perform the great work is ahead of you!"
victory18 = "I held back, and still you cower on the ground like a peon. What a waste of human life!"
victory19 = "I should have been conquering the world, not wasting my time with the likes of you."
victory20 = "Not bad, but still you fall short of the perfection I embody."
victory21 = "You actually made me pay attention to this fight, for a moment."
victory22 = "I understand your jealousy. There is a huge gap between humans and a god."
victory23 = "You were only slightly easier to defeat than the one who came before me."
victory24 = "You cannot defeat me because you cannot deny me."
victory25 = "For thou art dust and dust I shalt pound thy into!"
victory26 = "Now! What is the one thing you've learned from your humiliation! \nTell me now!"
victory27 = "Defeating me would mean leading the world to destruction. \nAccept your divine punishment!"
victory28 = "I will never show mercy towards an idiot such as yourself..."
victory29 = "I respect you, passionate human warrior, but my respect will not save you!"
victory30 = "Martial arts exist solely to assert one's dominance over another."
victory31 = "You have proven to be an incompetent being, return to nothingness!"

;VS Alex
victory50 = "A mere street fighter like you has no chance to win... or even knock me off my feet!"

;VS Anakaris
victory51 = "Thou art a great prophet.. A pity that thou preach to those in need of salvation to idolize thyself in order to achieve it! \nThis, I do not tolerate!"

;VS Chun-Li
victory52 = "Chinese martial arts look beautiful. But, that is all."

;VS Dan
victory53 = "If you were reincarnated a hundred times, I would still rule.... And thou would still suck!"

;VS Dudley
victory54 = "You cling to your sense of pride like a fool on a sinking ship."
victory55 = "Your pride has done you in again... It's about time you lost it!"

;VS Edward Elric
victory56 = "You are mistaken, child. Unlike the false prophets you have witnessed, I am the true messiah. \nYour battered body is the very proof of it." 

;VS Elena
victory57 = "My power is righteous! Repent your misguided actions now!"

;VS Geese
victory58 = "Disappointed in your powers? Did you expected a 'greater' outcome when you challenged me!?"

;VS Gen
victory59 = "Even at your prime, your assassination techniques cannot affect me!"

;VS Gill
victory60 = "You dare to imitate my power? You shall suffer for this insult!"

;VS G.Rugal
victory61 = "I'm Impressed. With your new powers, you've stood longer than usual..."

;VS Godhood Chars 
victory62 = "I see thou have waited an eternity for thou emancipation...sadly it is thy time to fall from grace."

;VS Goenitz
victory63 = "You cannot hide from the sins you committed, I, the master of all, shall cast a punishment on you." 

;VS Gouki
victory64 = "Your destruction is the only thing that will save your cursed fist.... You should thank me!"

;VS Hugo
victory65 = "Your battered body should teach you something! Remember it if you dare to fight again."

;VS Ibuki
victory66 = "Your efforts are useless! Interfering with my divine plan will only serve to annoy me."

;VS Igniz
victory67 = "Kneel before me! A true god before you." 

;VS Iori
victory68 = "Tainted by sins, you are destined to be engulfed by the very flames you possess. \nLet me speed up the process as a show of mercy from your god!"

;VS Jedah
victory69 = "Behold, for thou hast fallen to the one true savior!"

;VS Jin Kazama
victory70 = "Devoured by the demonic gene, there's not much my divine power can do for you... Perish..." 

;VS Juri
victory71 = "Your insanity has brought you your destruction, be thankful it shall be brought by my hand!" 

;VS Kazuya Mishima
victory72 = "Thy accursed Devil gene offered no resistance to the all-mighty!" 

;VS Ken
victory73 = "Those fake flames fail to serve your immortality... Therefore, your end is near."
victory74 = "Your tongue isn't as sharp when you're lying prone on your back, is it kid? Where's your spirit?"

;VS Kyo
victory75 = "As much as I admire martial arts, my holy flames are unmatched!"

;VS Ninjas
victory76 = "Ninjitsu is a rare style that I respect, but you make a mockery of the art. You have no chance."

;VS Necro
victory77 = "It was a mistake to have considered you. Your pathetic destiny is now set in stone!"

;VS Ogre
victory78 = "You dare to challenge me?! You shall perish as the price for this foolish act!"

;VS Oro
victory79 = "Your Senjitsu is puny in comparison! Have you realized that my power is the only true power?!"

;VS Orochi
victory80 = "You? A sealed god? Being defeated by mere mortals, you've proven there to be only one god."

;VS Rugal
victory81 = "You do realize you're on borrowed time? That no longer matters, however, for that time ends now!"

;VS Ryu
victory82 = "If you let your troubled mind stand in your way, it doesn't take much to slaughter you."

;VS Saiki
victory83 = "Time isn't just a luxurious object one can control! I, the true master, can only possess this type of power!"

;VS Sean
victory84 = "Like a prayer without faith, your moves are incomplete. Your odds to win are 1 in a million."

;VS Seth
victory85 = "A pitiful display of raw power, you don't deserve the potential you were graced upon!"

;Tohno Shiki
victory86 = "Your unique ability has no effect on me. \nI am the entity, I exist for all. The same way all exists for me!"

;VS Urien
victory87 = "Brother... The differences between us are obvious. Go on your way now!"
victory88 = "Let me grant you your death as a show of mercy from your brother!"

;VS Violent Ken/Orochi Iori
victory89 = "Succumbing into the insanity has proven how weak you truly are, time to get purified!" 

;VS Yang	
victory90 = "Such a child! No matter how cool you think you are, death shall humble you!"

;VS Yun 
victory91 = "How unfortunate... Are you disappointed after seeing your true strength?"

;VS Yun/Yang
victory92 = "You and your brother could have challenged me together, but instead you perish apart."

;Oro
victory93 = "You are powerful for your old age, but my ambition surpasses yours a thousand fold."

;M.Bison
victory94 = "I have deemed thy Psycho Powers unfit for Salvation!"

